<title>JAPAN: Niko Niko Do - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Niko Niko Do - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 49.57		vs	   42.38</p>
<p> Operating	  792    million    vs	    1.15</p>
<p> Current	    708    million    vs	  766    million</p>
<p> Net		  316    million    vs	  368    million</p>
<p> EPS		   28.86 yen	  vs	   36.95 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Niko Niko Do Co Ltd is a Kumamoto-based supermarket chain.</p>
